<div class="callout--crisis wrapper">
  <h2>In crisis right now?</h2>
  <p>
    If you or someone you know is in immediate danger, call <strong>911</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    For a mental health, substance use, or suicide crisis, the
    <strong>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</strong> is free, confidential, and
    available 24/7 — call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>, or chat at
    <a href="https://988lifeline.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">988lifeline.org</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can also reach the <strong>SAMHSA National Helpline</strong> at
    <a href="tel:18006624357">1-800-662-4357</a> for free, confidential
    treatment referral and information, 24/7.
  </p>
</div>
